      "timestamp_sec": 409,
      "why": "Two concrete, portable memory design decisions."
    },
    {
      "text": "Every night, Eira runs a sleep cycle. It replays the day, locks in useful stuff, hunts for contradictions, gently forgets the stale junk, and turns the day's work into reusable skills.",
      "timestamp_sec": 409,
      "why": "Full description of the offline consolidation mechanism the talk is named for."
    },
    {
